02:14:59.333 --> 02:15:00.333
Iya, begitu.

02:15:02.433 --> 02:15:03.433
Buka kakinya.

02:15:09.966 --> 02:15:11.266
Ayo, buka kakinya.

02:15:47.200 --> 02:15:48.966
Hadap sini, hadap sini.

02:15:50.166 --> 02:15:51.166
Nungging.

02:15:52.033 --> 02:15:53.033
Isap, ayo isap.

02:17:20.500 --> 02:17:23.200
Kalau suaramu terlalu keras,
nanti bisa kedengaran yang lain.

02:17:32.300 --> 02:17:33.300
Sakit.

02:18:57.000 --> 02:18:58.700
Sudah waktunya gantian.

02:19:02.733 --> 02:19:04.433
